==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*5 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Madam Peng]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Malizabeth]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Possessed Gold Nyanko Ranger]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[H. Nah]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**1 [[Malizabeth]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A challenging stage! Kill Madam Peng and Scissoroo with [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] while stacking [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]], [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Rangers]], and [[Fedora Cat (Special Cat)|Blue Nyanko Rangers]]. You'll want [[Yellow Strike (Combo)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger's Cat Combo]] to protect your cats from both Malizabeths and Possessed Gold Nyanko Ranger's Wave Attacks. Meatshielding during the boss wave is very difficult with Possessed Gold Nyanko Ranger's constant assault, so your ranger cats will serve as your primary layer of protection for when [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] can't hold the line. You still want to spawn other backline or midranged units like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] (or just Macho Leg/King Dragon) to deal with the Scissoroos and Madam Pengs. Once [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Rex]] finally goes off cooldown, you'll have a consistent source of DPS against the two big threats of this stage, so be sure to protect them well using the [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast Cannon]]. It doesn't really matter whether Possessed Gold Nyanko Ranger or H-Nah dies first, since the other threat will lose its biggest support.

